{"hw":"μηκέτι","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">μηκέτι</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">μηκέτι</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span>, (formed from <span class=\"gk\">μή, ἔτι</span>, with <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">κ</span> inserted on a false analogy with <span class=\"gk\">οὐκέτι</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">no more, no longer, no further</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13.292</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hes.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Op.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">174</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">O.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.5</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ch.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">805</span> </span> (lyr.), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.75.29</span> </span>, etc.</div></div>"}